WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The final phase of the comparative simulation is shown in three labeled panels: VLA-50 on the left, VLA-80 in the center, and HOIST on the right. Each humanoid guides a cable-suspended box over a rectangular landing platform.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The boxes continue settling toward the platforms. Their positions and orientations change while the humanoids maintain or adjust contact.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The final views show the boxes' positions relative to their landing platforms. This continues the same simulation excerpted in the task overview and method sections; it is not a separate trial. Quantitative outcomes are provided in the results tables.
